@startuml UC-38 Add Student - Sequence Diagram (icon)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.12.2.8 UC-38 Add Student — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
boundary ":AddStudentPage" as UI
control ":ClassController" as CTL
control ":ClassEnrollmentService" as SVC
boundary ":ClassMemberRepository" as MEM
boundary ":AppUserRepository" as USERS
database DB

autonumber
Teacher ->> UI : Select "Add Student" on the Class Members screen of an owned ACTIVE class, then enter the student full name, phone number, date of birth and Gmail and click "Add"
activate UI
UI ->> UI : handleAddStudent(event)
UI ->> CTL : POST /api/classes/{id}/members
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : addStudent(classId, fullName, phoneNumber, dateOfBirth, email)
activate SVC
SVC ->> SVC : resolve the class and accept only an owned class that is still ACTIVE, with a valid Gmail and a complete student profile
SVC ->> USERS : findByEmail(email)
activate USERS
USERS ->> DB : SELECT * FROM app_users WHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB -->> USERS : row / none
deactivate DB
USERS -->> SVC : AppUser
deactivate USERS
SVC ->> MEM : existsByClassIdAndStudentId(classId, studentId)
activate MEM
MEM ->> DB : SELECT 1 FROM class_members WHERE class_id = ? AND student_id = ? AND status = 'ENROLLED'
activate DB
DB -->> MEM : match / none
deactivate DB
MEM -->> SVC : boolean
deactivate MEM
SVC ->> SVC : reject an already enrolled Gmail, a disabled account, a conflicting role or a profile that does not match the existing account

alt class is not owned or is INACTIVE, the entered student data is invalid, or the Gmail is already enrolled
  SVC -->> CTL : ForbiddenOperationException / IllegalArgumentException / ClassEnrollmentConflictException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 403 / 400 / 409
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG23, MSG02, MSG03 or the already-enrolled message and keep the Class Members list unchanged

else the teacher owns an ACTIVE class and the entered student data is valid
  SVC ->> SVC : create a student account for a Gmail that has no account yet and grant it the STUDENT role
  SVC ->> MEM : save(ClassMember with status ENROLLED)
  activate MEM
  MEM ->> DB : INSERT INTO class_members enrollment columns
  activate DB
  DB -->> MEM : Saved
  deactivate DB
  MEM -->> SVC : ClassMember
  deactivate MEM
  SVC -->> CTL : MemberSummary
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 201 + ClassMember
  UI ->> UI : loadMembers(id)
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG08 and the refreshed Class Members list containing the added student
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
